@startuml dp5-singleton
!include _style.puml
title DP#5 Singleton - 전역 설정 단일 인스턴스
class AppConfig <<Singleton>> {
  -instance: AppConfig
  -fontFamily: String
  -fontSize: int
  -displayLocale: Locale
  -currency: Currency
  -modernTheme: boolean
  -showSeatMetadata: boolean
  --
  +getInstance(): AppConfig
  +getFontFamily(): String
  +setFontFamily(): void
  +getFontSize(): int
  +setFontSize(): void
  +getDisplayLocale(): Locale
  +setDisplayLocale(): void
  +getCurrency(): Currency
  +setCurrency(): void
  +isModernTheme(): boolean
  +setModernTheme(): void
  +isShowSeatMetadata(): boolean
  +setShowSeatMetadata(): void
  +addChangeListener(): void
  +removeChangeListener(): void
  -notifyListeners(): void
}
AppConfig ..> AppConfig : getInstance() (DCL)
note bottom of AppConfig : private 생성자, 단일 인스턴스
@enduml
